# Excluded from synthesis AND placement.
#
# CGTSX*: scan clock gates, and DFFMRQX2: scan flop. No scan chain in this
# design. CGX1/2/3 are not here: an entry for them is inert, since the resizer
# does not size a clock gate (doc/sg13cmos5l_adaptation.md).
#
# Until the September 2026 drop CGTSX* was also wrong in silicon (enable
# inverted) and DFFRQ2X*/DFFRQ4X* excluded for a broken Verilog view. Both are
# fixed, see doc/sclqa_report.md.
#
# LibreLane's process_list_file takes '#' comments and blank lines.
CGTSX1
CGTSX1P5
CGTSX2
CGTSX3
DFFMRQX2
